{"id":"6a08564d6160b86c","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-link-groups.md","title":"Link Groups","display":"df-link-groups — Link Groups","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-link-groups","aliases":["58-df-link-groups","Link Groups"],"display":"df-link-groups — Link Groups","depends_on":["[[58-df-link]]","[[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-link-groups"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-link-groups</span><span>Link Groups</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-link-groups — Link Groups"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"257329a60eacb063\" href=\"?note=257329a60eacb063\" title=\"58-df-link\">58-df-link</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\ell,m,G,x_0,\\tau_{S^3}\\in V\">\\(L,\\ell,m,G,x_0,\\tau_{S^3}\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathbb R^4:\\|p\\|_2=1\\}\">\\(S^3\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathbb R^4:\\|p\\|_2=1\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^3}\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap S^3:U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^4\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^4\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{S^3}\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap S^3:U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^4\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^4\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"257329a60eacb063\" href=\"?note=257329a60eacb063\" title=\"58-df-link\">58-df-link</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\">\\(\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinkGroup}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{LinkGroup}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link\\text{-}groups}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{LinkGroup}_S(G,L,\\ell,m,x_0,\\tau_{S^3})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\land x_0\\in S^3\\setminus L\\\\\n&amp;\\land G=\\pi_1\\!\\left(S^3\\setminus L,\\{U\\cap(S^3\\setminus L):U\\in\\tau_{S^3}\\},x_0\\right).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link\\text{-}groups}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{LinkGroup}_S(G,L,\\ell,m,x_0,\\tau_{S^3})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\land x_0\\in S^3\\setminus L\\\\\n&amp;\\land G=\\pi_1\\!\\left(S^3\\setminus L,\\{U\\cap(S^3\\setminus L):U\\in\\tau_{S^3}\\},x_0\\right).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The link group is the fundamental group of the complement; by itself it is not a complete invariant of links.</li>\n<li>Wirtinger presentation: generators = arcs, relators = crossing relations</li>\n<li>Peripheral: meridian + longitude per component; abelianization <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong \\mathbb{Z}^m\">\\(\\cong \\mathbb{Z}^m\\)</span></li>\n<li>A preferred longitude is fixed only after the usual orientation and peripheral choices; the peripheral system carries information not present in the abstract group alone.</li>\n<li>Alexander polynomial: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_L\">\\(\\Delta_L\\)</span> is link invariant; for knots <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_K(t)\">\\(\\Delta_K(t)\\)</span> normalized to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_K(t) = \\Delta_K(t^{-1})\">\\(\\Delta_K(t) = \\Delta_K(t^{-1})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rolfsen, Knots and Links</li>\n<li>Crowell and Fox, Introduction to Knot Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-link","status":"resolved","id":"257329a60eacb063","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-link]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-link","status":"resolved","id":"257329a60eacb063","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)$ (see [[58-df-link]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\ell,m,G,x_0,\\tau_{S^3}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S^3\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathbb R^4:\\|p\\|_2=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^3}\\coloneqq\\{U\\cap S^3:U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^4\\land\\forall p\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R^4\\;(\\|q-p\\|_2<\\varepsilon\\to q\\in U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1(X,\\tau_X,x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinkGroup}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link\\text{-}groups}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{LinkGroup}_S(G,L,\\ell,m,x_0,\\tau_{S^3})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\land x_0\\in S^3\\setminus L\\\\\n&\\land G=\\pi_1\\!\\left(S^3\\setminus L,\\{U\\cap(S^3\\setminus L):U\\in\\tau_{S^3}\\},x_0\\right).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\cong \\mathbb{Z}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_K(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_K(t) = \\Delta_K(t^{-1})","display":false}],"bytes":1763,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-790","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-link-groups.md|58-df-link-groups]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["257329a60eacb063","c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b"]}